      "writtenOn": "2019-03-11T08:30:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that AnswerCallback and its on* methods are all public and no @hide, so we can\u0027t hide any of them on subclass.\nAnd the reason for why no onError or onAnswer here is that they are not implemented, still abstract.",
      "parentUuid": "83225173_d3c00c94",
