        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-08T09:16:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t know about CancellationSignal. :-) You mean that the app will pass in a CancellationSignal, and the DNS code will do something like this?\n\n    if (signal !\u003d null) {\n        signal.setCancellationListener(() -\u003e {\n            queue.removeOnFileDescriptorEventListener(queryFd);\n            resNetworkCancel(queryFd));\n        });\n    }\n\nThat seems like a better idea, thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "39843f7c_3fb38f2b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27254,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 27254,
